        "accession_number": "0001528396-25-000221",
        "filing_date": "2025-09-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As of July 31, 2025, we had 3,772 employees, including 1,879 in global product development and operations (comprised of research and development, cloud operations, and technical support), 873 in professional services, 533 in sales and marketing, and 487 in general and administrative roles.",
        "start_character": 27242,
        "end_character": 27532
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001528396-25-000221",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001528396-25-000221-667bf6030dab2513",
        "accession_number": "0001528396-25-000221",
        "filing_date": "2025-09-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As part of our PartnerConnect alliance program, we have a community of solution partners developing integrations that enable software and insurance business solutions to interoperate with our products, many of which are in the Guidewire Marketplace.",
        "start_character": 34909,
        "end_character": 35158
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001528396-25-000221",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001528396-25-000221-667bf6030dab2513",
        "accession_number": "0001528396-25-000221",
        "filing_date": "2025-09-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To support our core products, we provide digital engagement offerings that enable seamless sales, omnichannel service, and enhanced claims experiences for policyholders, agents, vendors, and field personnel and analytics products that allow insurers to manage and use data more effectively, gain business insights, improve operational efficiency, and underwrite emerging risks.",
        "start_character": 960,
        "end_character": 1337
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001528396-25-000221",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001528396-25-000221-667bf6030dab2513",
        "accession_number": "0001528396-25-000221",
        "filing_date": "2025-09-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also invest significantly in developing our products and necessary integrations to meet the market requirements, including regulations, language, currency, and local terminology, of each country or state in which our customers operate.",
        "start_character": 37497,
        "end_character": 37735
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001528396-25-000221",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001528396-25-000221-667bf6030dab2513",
        "accession_number": "0001528396-25-000221",
        "filing_date": "2025-09-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer term licenses, primarily for existing on-premise customers, as well as support and professional services.",
        "start_character": 2986,
        "end_character": 3105
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001528396-25-000221",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001528396-25-000221-667bf6030dab2513",
        "accession_number": "0001528396-25-000221",
